---
const steps = [
  ['01', 'Elige la música', 'Desde Spotify, YouTube, Apple Music o cualquier app en tu celular.'],
  ['02', 'Crea la sesión', 'Tu celular envía el audio al anfitrión sin cables ni configuraciones por auto.'],
  ['03', 'Conecta los carros', 'Cada receptor recibe la misma señal y mantiene el beat alineado.']
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="description" content="SyncRide convierte varios autos estacionados en una sola experiencia de música sincronizada." />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#10100e" />
    <title>SyncRide — Que todos escuchen lo mismo</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="nav shell">
      <a class="brand" href="#inicio" aria-label="SyncRide, inicio"><span class="brand-mark"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>Sync<b>Ride</b></span></a>
      <nav><a href="#problema">El problema</a><a href="#solucion">La solución</a><a href="#mvp">El experimento</a></nav>
      <a class="nav-link" href="#espera">Sigue el proyecto <span>↗</span></a>
    </header>
    <main id="inicio">
      <section class="hero shell">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Música compartida para estacionamientos</p>
          <h1>Que todos<br /><em>escuchen lo mismo.</em></h1>
          <p class="hero-lede">Cuando cada amigo conecta su propio carro, la canción empieza tarde, el bajo no pega igual y la energía se rompe. SyncRide convierte varios autos en una sola sesión.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#solucion">Entender la idea <b>↓</b></a><a class="text-link" href="#mvp">Ver cómo lo probamos <span>↗</span></a></div>
          <div class="hero-note"><i></i><span>Una fuente. Una sesión.<br /><strong>Todos al mismo beat.</strong></span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-card"><div class="hero-image"><img src="/hero-cars.png" alt="Varios autos estacionados compartiendo una sesión de música" /><div class="image-shade"></div><div class="session-label"><span class="live"></span><span>SESSION 001</span><b>SYNCED</b></div></div><div class="hero-card-foot"><span>03 autos</span><span>01 experiencia</span><span>0 cables entre amigos</span></div></div>
      </section>
      <section class="problem shell" id="problema">
        <div class="problem-head"><p class="eyebrow">El momento que queremos arreglar</p><p class="section-kicker">La música ya está ahí.<br /><strong>Lo que falta es compartirla.</strong></p></div>
        <div class="problem-grid"><div class="problem-statement"><span class="quote-mark">“</span><h2>Un carro pone la canción, otro llega tarde y el tercero ya está en otro track.</h2><p>En una reunión de amigos, el audio se divide justo cuando debería unirlos.</p></div><div class="problem-list"><div><span>01</span><p><strong>Conectar uno por uno</strong><br />Cada radio tiene su propio proceso y sus propias limitaciones.</p></div><div><span>02</span><p><strong>Escuchar desfases</strong><br />El mismo beat llega con milisegundos distintos a cada carro.</p></div><div><span>03</span><p><strong>Perder la energía</strong><br />La playlist sigue, pero la experiencia deja de sentirse colectiva.</p></div></div></div>
      </section>
      <section class="promise shell" id="solucion">
        <div class="promise-copy"><p class="eyebrow">La propuesta</p><h2>Un estacionamiento.<br /><em>Un solo sistema de sonido.</em></h2><p>SyncRide toma el audio de un celular, lo convierte en una sesión local y lo distribuye a cada auto. No importa qué app uses: importa que todos reciban la misma señal.</p><a class="text-link" href="#pasos">Así funciona <span>↘</span></a></div>
        <div class="promise-visual"><div class="source-pill"><span>♫</span><div><small>FUENTE INALÁMBRICA</small><strong>Cualquier app de audio</strong></div><b>1</b></div><div class="beam"></div><div class="hub"><span>✦</span><div><small>SESIÓN LOCAL</small><strong>SyncRide hub</strong></div></div><div class="beam split"></div><div class="car-pills"><div><i>A</i><span>Auto 01</span><b></b></div><div><i>B</i><span>Auto 02</span><b></b></div><div><i>C</i><span>Auto 03</span><b></b></div></div></div>
      </section>
      <section class="steps shell" id="pasos"><div class="steps-head"><p class="eyebrow">De la playlist al primer beat</p><h2>Tan simple para la banda.<br /><span>Tan preciso para el sistema.</span></h2></div><div class="step-grid">{steps.map(([id, title, text]) => <article><small>{id}</small><div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></div></article>)}</div></section>
      <section class="mvp shell" id="mvp"><div class="mvp-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Empezamos por comprobar una cosa</p><h2>¿Puede sentirse<br /><em>como una sola canción?</em></h2><p>El primer experimento usa una Raspberry Pi, Wi‑Fi local y un receptor por auto. AUX nos da una salida controlada para medir sincronización antes de hacer la experiencia completamente inalámbrica.</p><div class="mvp-proof"><div><strong>&lt; 5 ms</strong><span>objetivo de diferencia</span></div><div><strong>30 min</strong><span>prueba inicial estable</span></div></div></div><div class="mvp-image"><img src="/hero-cars.png" alt="Detalle visual de la sesión sincronizada entre autos" /><div><span>FIRST TEST</span><b>Wi‑Fi local · AUX</b></div></div></section>
      <section class="waitlist shell" id="espera"><div><p class="eyebrow">El proyecto está tomando forma</p><h2>¿Quieres estar cuando<br /><em>suene la primera sesión?</em></h2></div><form onsubmit="return false"><label for="email">Déjanos tu correo</label><div><input id="email" type="email" placeholder="tu@correo.com" /><button type="submit">Avísame ↗</button></div><small>Solo avances del prototipo. Nada de spam.</small></form></section>
    </main>
    <footer class="footer shell"><a class="brand" href="#inicio"><span class="brand-mark"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>Sync<b>Ride</b></span></a><p>Una experiencia compartida, no tres reproducciones separadas.</p><small>© 2026 · prototype in progress</small></footer>
  </body>
</html>
<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');
:root{--bg:#10100e;--paper:#f0eee8;--muted:#9c9b91;--line:#2b2b25;--acid:#d7f36f;--violet:#917dff;--orange:#f08b5d}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--paper);font-family:Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.shell{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 64px));margin:auto}.nav{height:90px;display:flex;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font:600 20px/1 'Space Grotesk';letter-spacing:-.05em}.brand b{color:var(--violet)}.brand-mark{display:flex;align-items:end;gap:3px;height:20px}.brand-mark i{display:block;width:4px;background:var(--acid);border-radius:4px}.brand-mark i:nth-child(1){height:9px}.brand-mark i:nth-child(2){height:16px}.brand-mark i:nth-child(3){height:12px;background:var(--violet)}nav{display:flex;gap:30px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:42px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}nav a:hover,.text-link:hover{color:var(--acid)}.nav-link{font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.nav-link span,.text-link span{color:var(--acid);font-size:17px;margin-left:6px}.hero{min-height:650px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:50% 50%;align-items:center;gap:40px;padding:74px 0 96px}.eyebrow{font:500 10px/1 'DM Mono';letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--acid);margin:0 0 27px}.eyebrow span{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--acid);border-radius:50%;margin-right:9px;box-shadow:0 0 14px var(--acid)}h1,h2,h3,p{margin-top:0}h1{font:600 clamp(57px,6.5vw,91px)/.91 'Space Grotesk';letter-spacing:-.085em;margin-bottom:31px}h1 em,h2 em,h2 span{font-style:normal;color:var(--violet)}.hero-lede{max-width:470px;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:35px}.hero-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:29px}.button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;padding:15px 18px;background:var(--acid);color:#151611;border-radius:2px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.button b{font-size:17px}.text-link{font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.hero-note{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:51px;color:#707168;font:10px/1.6 'DM Mono'}.hero-note i{width:34px;height:1px;background:var(--violet)}.hero-note strong{font-weight:400;color:var(--paper)}.hero-card{background:#1a1a16;padding:10px;transform:rotate(2deg);box-shadow:24px 28px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.14)}.hero-image{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1.18;overflow:hidden}.hero-image img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.image-shade{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(13,13,10,.8),transparent 55%),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(13,13,10,.45),transparent)}.session-label{position:absolute;z-index:1;left:20px;right:20px;bottom:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font:10px 'DM Mono'}.session-label .live{width:6px;height:6px;background:var(--orange);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--orange)}.session-label b{margin-left:auto;color:var(--acid);font-weight:400}.hero-card-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:15px 8px 4px;color:#85857a;font:9px 'DM Mono';text-transform:uppercase}.problem{padding:136px 0 150px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.problem-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:50% 50%;margin-bottom:78px}.problem-head .eyebrow{margin:0}.section-kicker{font:500 25px/1.2 'Space Grotesk';letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:0}.section-kicker strong{color:var(--violet);font-weight:500}.problem-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:54% 46%;gap:50px}.problem-statement{position:relative;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:36px 25px 0 0}.quote-mark{position:absolute;top:26px;right:25px;color:var(--acid);font:80px/.7 'Space Grotesk'}.problem-statement h2{max-width:560px;font:500 clamp(32px,3.7vw,52px)/1.05 'Space Grotesk';letter-spacing:-.065em;margin:0 0 24px}.problem-statement p{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;max-width:330px}.problem-list{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.problem-list>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:45px 1fr;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.problem-list span{font:10px 'DM Mono';color:var(--violet)}.problem-list p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.problem-list strong{color:var(--paper);font-weight:600}.promise{display:grid;grid-template-columns:42% 58%;gap:50px;align-items:center;padding:110px 0 140px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.promise-copy h2,.steps-head h2,.mvp h2{font:500 clamp(37px,4.4vw,59px)/.98 'Space Grotesk';letter-spacing:-.07em;margin:0 0 29px}.promise-copy>p,.mvp-copy>p{max-width:370px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:27px}.promise-visual{background:#171713;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:39px 40px 34px}.source-pill,.hub{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px}.source-pill>span,.hub>span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--violet);font-size:19px}.source-pill small,.hub small,.car-pills span{display:block;font:9px 'DM Mono';color:#78786e}.source-pill strong,.hub strong{font:500 13px 'Space Grotesk'}.source-pill>b{margin-left:auto;font:11px 'DM Mono';color:var(--acid)}.beam{height:42px;border-left:1px dashed var(--violet);margin:0 0 0 18px}.hub>span{background:var(--acid);color:#171713}.split{height:38px;border-left:0;border-top:1px dashed var(--violet);margin:0 0 0 18px}.car-pills{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:15px}.car-pills>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:25px 1fr;gap:7px 8px;align-items:center}.car-pills i{grid-row:span 2;display:grid;place-items:center;width:25px;height:25px;border:1px solid var(--violet);border-radius:50%;font:10px 'DM Mono';font-style:normal;color:var(--paper)}.car-pills b{grid-column:2;height:2px;background:var(--acid);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--acid)}.steps{padding:100px 0 140px}.steps-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;margin-bottom:64px}.steps-head .eyebrow{width:42%;margin:0}.step-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.step-grid article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:42px 1fr;gap:17px;padding:25px 22px 0 0;border-right:1px solid var(--line);margin-right:24px}.step-grid article:last-child{border:0;margin:0}.step-grid small{font:10px 'DM Mono';color:var(--violet)}.step-grid h3{font:500 22px 'Space Grotesk';letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:0 0 12px}.step-grid p{max-width:240px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;margin:0}.mvp{display:grid;grid-template-columns:45% 55%;gap:50px;padding:100px 0 140px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.mvp-copy>p{margin-top:29px}.mvp-proof{display:flex;gap:40px;margin-top:34px}.mvp-proof div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}.mvp-proof strong{font:500 25px 'Space Grotesk';letter-spacing:-.05em}.mvp-proof span{font:9px 'DM Mono';color:#77776e;text-transform:uppercase}.mvp-image{position:relative;height:310px;overflow:hidden;background:#171713}.mvp-image img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;filter:saturate(.75)}.mvp-image:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(16,16,14,.65),transparent 70%)}.mvp-image>div{position:absolute;z-index:1;left:25px;bottom:21px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;font:10px 'DM Mono'}.mvp-image span{color:var(--acid)}.mvp-image b{font-weight:400;color:var(--paper)}.waitlist{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:60px 62px;background:var(--violet);color:#15141d}.waitlist .eyebrow{color:#32266e;margin-bottom:18px}.waitlist h2{font:500 42px/.98 'Space Grotesk';letter-spacing:-.065em;margin:0}.waitlist h2 em{color:#e3dfff}.waitlist form{width:38%}.waitlist label{display:block;font:10px 'DM Mono';text-transform:uppercase;color:#dcd5ff;margin-bottom:10px}.waitlist form>div{display:flex;border-bottom:1px solid #51458e}.waitlist input{width:100%;padding:12px 0;border:0;background:transparent;outline:0;font:13px Manrope}.waitlist input::placeholder{color:#574b91}.waitlist button{border:0;background:transparent;font:700 12px Manrope;color:#17151f;cursor:pointer}.waitlist form small{display:block;margin-top:10px;color:#d7d0ff;font:9px 'DM Mono'}.footer{display:flex;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:28px 0 40px}.footer p,.footer>small{font:9px 'DM Mono';color:#77776e;margin:0 0 0 26px}.footer>small{margin-left:auto}@media(max-width:760px){.shell{width:min(100% - 40px,560px)}.nav{height:74px}.nav nav,.nav-link{display:none}.hero{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;padding:66px 0 83px;gap:52px}.hero-card{transform:rotate(1deg)}h1{font-size:59px}.hero-lede{font-size:14px}.problem{padding:92px 0}.problem-head,.problem-grid,.promise,.mvp{display:block}.problem-head{margin-bottom:48px}.section-kicker{font-size:22px;margin-top:30px}.problem-statement{padding-top:28px}.problem-list{margin-top:52px}.promise{padding:78px 0 95px}.promise-visual{margin-top:52px;padding:27px 19px 30px}.car-pills{gap:8px}.car-pills span{font-size:8px}.steps{padding:75px 0 92px}.steps-head{display:block;margin-bottom:42px}.steps-head .eyebrow{width:auto;margin-bottom:28px}.step-grid{display:block}.step-grid article{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:23px 0;margin:0}.mvp{padding:76px 0 90px}.mvp-image{margin-top:50px;height:245px}.mvp-proof{gap:25px}.waitlist{display:block;padding:37px 25px}.waitlist h2{font-size:34px}.waitlist form{width:100%;margin-top:42px}.footer{display:block}.footer p{margin:22px 0}.footer>small{display:block;margin:0}}
</style>

<style>
@media (max-width: 960px) and (min-width: 761px) {
  .shell { width: min(100% - 48px, 860px); }
  nav { gap: 18px; margin-right: 24px; }
  .hero { grid-template-columns: 46% 54%; gap: 24px; padding: 58px 0 76px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(54px, 7vw, 72px); }
  .hero-lede { font-size: 14px; }
  .hero-card { transform: rotate(1deg); }
  .problem-grid { gap: 28px; }
  .promise { grid-template-columns: 43% 57%; gap: 24px; }
  .promise-visual { padding: 28px 24px 26px; }
  .mvp { grid-template-columns: 44% 56%; gap: 25px; }
  .waitlist { padding: 46px 38px; }
}

@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .shell { width: calc(100% - 32px); }
  .nav { height: 68px; }
  .brand { font-size: 18px; }
  .hero { padding: 54px 0 70px; gap: 42px; }
  .hero-copy { min-width: 0; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(48px, 15vw, 68px); }
  .hero-lede { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .hero-actions { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; }
  .button { min-height: 48px; }
  .hero-card { transform: none; box-shadow: 12px 16px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.14); }
  .hero-card-foot { gap: 10px; font-size: 8px; }
  .hero-card-foot span:last-child { text-align: right; }
  .problem-head { display: block; }
  .problem-head .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 26px; }
  .section-kicker { font-size: 24px; }
  .problem-grid { display: block; }
  .problem-statement h2 { font-size: clamp(32px, 9vw, 45px); }
  .problem-list { margin-top: 46px; }
  .promise-copy h2, .steps-head h2, .mvp h2 { font-size: clamp(38px, 10vw, 52px); }
  .promise-visual { overflow: hidden; }
  .source-pill strong, .hub strong { font-size: 12px; }
  .source-pill small, .hub small { font-size: 8px; }
  .car-pills { gap: 7px; }
  .car-pills span { font-size: 8px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .step-grid article { grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr; }
  .mvp-proof { flex-wrap: wrap; row-gap: 22px; }
  .mvp-proof strong { font-size: 23px; }
  .waitlist { margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; width: 100%; }
}

@media (max-width: 420px) {
  .shell { width: calc(100% - 28px); }
  .eyebrow { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .06em; }
  h1 { font-size: 48px; }
  .hero-actions { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
  .hero-card-foot { flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .hero-card-foot span:last-child { width: 100%; text-align: left; }
  .promise-visual { padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; }
  .source-pill { gap: 9px; }
  .source-pill>span, .hub>span { width: 31px; height: 31px; font-size: 16px; }
  .car-pills i { width: 22px; height: 22px; }
  .car-pills>div { grid-template-columns: 22px 1fr; }
  .mvp-proof { gap: 19px; }
  .mvp-proof span { font-size: 8px; }
  .waitlist { padding: 32px 20px; }
  .waitlist h2 { font-size: 32px; }
}
</style>
